    "scenesThatPass": [
      "EMMA: Mom. Mom.\nBRIDGET: Shame on you girls. What is the matter with you?\nBRIDGET: What? You have to stand up for yourself, you have to fight back. Show some self-respect, don’t be a doormat --\nEMMA: Shhhhhh!",
      "BRIDGET: You should not be smoking. It is terrible for you. What is going on with you?\nEMMA: Nothing.\nBRIDGET: You look absolutely ridiculous.\nEMMA: Thank you.",
      "EMMA: Mom!\nBRIDGET: Sorry. Mary and Daniel are here.\nEMMA: David.\nBRIDGET: David! David David David --",
      "BRIDGET: Mom?\nRUTH: Is that my baby?\nRUTH: Oh, I’m so happy to see you --",
      "RUTH: And this baby too?\nRUTH: Honey!\nEMMA: Hi Grama.\nRUTH: You need some money? Let me getcha some money."
    ]
